OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1795627572
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS Army says controlled blast of
OL,4,Aexplosives in Iowa was 'huge success'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt also warned locals of "potential
OL,7,Fexposure to toxic lead dust" - an
OL,8,Foptional evacuation zone and a shelter
OL,9,Fin place advisory were among the
OL,10,Fmeasures in place
OL,12,FSome residents living nearby say they
OL,13,Fdid not "hear a thing", while others in
OL,14,Fthe area report it sounding "like
OL,15,Fsomething huge just exploded"
OL,17,FOver in neighbouring Missouri, the
OL,18,Fgovernor says initial analysis suggests
OL,19,F"mitigation measures appear to have
OL,20,Fbeen successful"
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
